WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.420
Quick one.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.800
Why is it colder in winter?

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.740
Because the Earth is farther from the sun?

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.460
Good guess.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:15.580
Then why is it summer in Sydney when it's winter in Toronto?

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:17.453
Oh.

00:00:17.873 --> 00:00:21.203
Same distance, both places.

00:00:21.253 --> 00:00:23.613
So it's not distance.

00:00:24.433 --> 00:00:26.373
Is it the tilt?

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:28.267
Keep going.

00:00:28.867 --> 00:00:31.687
What does the tilt do to the sunlight?

00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:36.873
It hits us at a low angle, so the same light spreads out thinner.

00:00:38.053 --> 00:00:38.603
Exactly.

00:00:38.653 --> 00:00:42.153
We're actually closest to the sun in January.

00:00:42.373 --> 00:00:44.793
You worked that out — I only asked.
